  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[G#m] [E7] (x4)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[G#m]Hand over my face.\n[G#m]I am related to my enemy.\n[G#m]My house on fire,\n[G#m]And my big brother tried to put the blame on me.\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[G#m]Oh, little sister, [F#]you and me can rise above [G#m]\n[F#]Oh, ain't no brother, back to back to back [G#m]\nOh better back on\n\n{section: Instrumental}\n[G#m] (x4)\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[G#m]You use the flag as a bandage\n[G#m]Oh my big brother's a pocket hypocrisy\n[G#m]In the closet, my pleasures...\n[G#m]Brother don't wanna just let me be\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[G#m]Oh, little sister, [F#]you and me can rise above [G#m]\n[F#]Oh, ain't no brother, back to back to back [G#m]\nOh better back on\n[G#m]Oh, little sister, [F#]you and me can walk alone [G#m]\n[F#]Oh, ain't no brother, back to back to back [G#m] [E7]\nOh better back on\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[G#m]Hey now, ooooh [E7]\n[G#m]Hey now, yeah [E7]\n[G#m]Hey now, yeah [E7]\n[G#m]Hey now [E7] [C#]\n\n{section: Interlúdio}\n[B]In my mind there's a clearing\n[B]Rose gardens open grey skies [G#m]\n[B]Oh no one's hurtin' [G#m]\n[B]And I'm joyin' [G#m]\n[B]I'm flying [G#m]\n\n{section: Solo}\n[G#m] (x8)\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[G#m]Back to back to back, oh better back on [F#]\n[G#m]Back to back to back, back c'mon [F#]\n[F#]Back to back to back..., back, ooooh [G#m] [E7]\n\n{section: Outro}\n[G#m]Hey now, Brother [E7]\n[G#m]Hey now, oh oh oh oh [E7]\n(repete ate o fade...)"
